            <title>[KYLIN-5791] Using CAST function to convert timestapadd to varchar does not return the result in the required time format</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5791</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Query statement: SELECT CAST(TIMESTAMPADD(MONTH, -1, TO_DATE(&apos;2023-07-31&apos;, &apos;yyyy-MM-dd&apos;)) AS VARCHAR)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The result of the TIMESTAMPADD function here is 2023-06-30, but when using the CAST function for conversion, it becomes 2023-06-30 00:00:00.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
